{
  "description": "Row 20 replacement of v3-stop-path-none-host-relay-admitted-when-allowed.json (it supersedes that case: frame_required, row 20): the same assertions with a capture of window 101 before the click of each engine process, since a click needs a frame. No local listener (listener none), the session opened with allowHostRelayOnlyStop true and its host keeping the heartbeat fresh: the click is admitted on the host-relay stop path and its events reach the sink. Opened with the policy off, the same click is refused StopPathUnavailable{reason:host_relay_not_allowed} with nothing more sent.",
  "supersedes": [
    "v3-stop-path-none-host-relay-admitted-when-allowed.json"
  ],
  "transport": "stdio",
